エモかったね。ほんと！
It was so emotional. Really!

281
00:31:18,732 --> 00:31:20,052
エモかった！どうですか？エモかったですか？
It was emotional! How was it? Was it emotional?

282
00:31:19,932 --> 00:31:21,472
泣いちゃったよ、リオナちゃん！
I almost cried, Riona!

283
00:31:21,472 --> 00:31:22,852
泣いちゃった、泣いちゃった！
You cried, you cried!

284
00:31:22,852 --> 00:31:25,572
レコーダーよ、ちょっと！いや、みんな泣いてるからさ...
Recorder, wait! No, everybody's crying...

285
00:31:25,572 --> 00:31:27,492
泣いちゃった、泣いちゃった！
You cried, you cried!

286
00:31:27,492 --> 00:31:30,332
みんなとこうやってね、みんなの誕生日ライブが...
Getting to do this with everyone, wondering if everyone's birthday live...

287
00:31:30,332 --> 00:31:32,732
合うかどうかもうわかんないんだけど！
would match or not, I don't even know anymore!

288
00:31:32,732 --> 00:31:34,972
いや、みんなだけあって、ニコたちないの？
Wait, is it only Niko? Do Niko and the others not cry?

289
00:31:34,972 --> 00:31:36,632
私も最初さ、
I was at first...

290
00:31:36,632 --> 00:31:38,312
どうしよう、どうしよう！
What should I do, what should I do!

291
00:31:38,312 --> 00:31:39,612
ないよ、ない！
No way, I didn't!

292
00:31:39,612 --> 00:31:42,572
ない、ない！リオナはどうだった？ねえ？
No, no! How about Riona? Right?

293
00:31:42,572 --> 00:31:47,452
みんな出してくれてありがとう！これだけでもね、やんわりとしておきまして...
Thank you everyone for letting us put it out! Let's keep it under wraps for now...

294
00:33:31,612 --> 00:33:41,352
まるでこの世界で二人だけみたいだね
It's as if we're the only two people in this world.

295
00:33:41,812 --> 00:33:51,692
なんて少しだけ夢を見てしまっただけ
I just dreamed a little dream like that for a moment.

296
00:33:51,992 --> 00:34:02,652
つま先に月明かり 花束の香り 指に触れる指
Moonlight on my toes, the scent of a bouquet, fingers touching fingers.

297
00:34:03,292 --> 00:34:13,292
さよなら もう行かなきゃ 何もかも忘れて
Goodbye, I have to go now, forgetting everything.

298
00:34:15,192 --> 00:34:22,972
硝子の上を裸足のまま歩く 痛むごとに血が流れて落ちていく
Walking barefoot across glass, blood flowing and dropping with every pain.

299
00:34:27,672 --> 00:34:37,068
お願い その赤い足跡を辿って 会いにきて
Please, follow those red footprints and come meet me.

300
00:37:40,091 --> 00:37:49,971
頬を刺す朝の山手通り 煙草の空き箱を捨てる
The morning Yamate Street piercing my cheeks, tossing an empty pack of cigarettes...

301
00:37:51,391 --> 00:37:57,591
今日もまた足の踏み場は無い 小部屋が孤独を甘やかす
Today too there's nowhere to step; a tiny room pampers my solitude...

302
00:37:58,391 --> 00:38:05,711
不穏な悲鳴を愛さないで 未来等 見ないで 確信出来る 現在だけ 重ねて
Don't love unsettling screams, don't look toward the future; pile up only the present we can believe in...

303
00:38:16,191 --> 00:38:27,571
あたしの名前をちゃんと呼んで 身体を触って 必要なのは 是だけ 認めて
Call my name properly, touch my body, and acknowledge that this is all I need...

304
00:38:41,471 --> 00:38:46,591
愛している 独り泣き喚いて
I love you, weeping and wailing alone...

305
00:38:46,891 --> 00:38:53,391
夜道を弄れど虚しい
Fumbling down the night road is all in vain...

306
00:38:53,971 --> 00:39:01,551
改札の安蛍光灯は 貴方の影すら落とさない
The cheap fluorescent lights of the ticket gate don't even cast your shadow...

307
00:39:01,971 --> 00:39:13,371
Ah 歪んだ無常の遠き日も セヴンスターの香り味わう如く 季節を呼び起こす
Ah, even those distant days of distorted inconstancy, like tasting the scent of Seven Stars, summon the season.

308
00:39:14,171 --> 00:39:23,571
あたしが望んだこと自体 矛盾を優に超えて 一番愛しいあなたの声迄
What I myself desired easily transcended contradiction, all the way to your dearest voice...

309
00:39:27,171 --> 00:39:36,971
掠れさせて居たのだろう
...which I had let grow hoarse.

310
00:39:57,571 --> 00:39:59,092
静寂を
Silence...

311
00:40:00,262 --> 00:40:02,722
頬を刺す朝の山手通り
Piercing morning on Yamanote Street,

312
00:40:02,902 --> 00:40:05,202
煙草の空き箱を捨てる
throwing away an empty cigarette pack,

313
00:40:05,702 --> 00:40:08,662
今日もまた足の踏み場は無い
today too, there's nowhere to step,

314
00:40:09,082 --> 00:40:14,902
サイレン 爆音 現実界 或る浮遊
Sirens, deafening roars, a certain floating reality.

315
00:40:15,622 --> 00:40:21,182
Ah 歪んだ無常の遠き日も
Ah, even those distant days of distorted impermanence,

316
00:40:21,182 --> 00:40:27,842
不穏な悲鳴を愛さないで 未来等見ないで
Don't love ominous screams, don't look toward a future or anything.

317
00:40:27,842 --> 00:40:30,502
確信出来る
I can be certain.

318
00:40:30,502 --> 00:40:34,042
現在だけ重ねてあたしの名前をちゃんと呼んで
Just overlap the present moment, call my name properly,

319
00:40:34,042 --> 00:40:44,902
身体を触って 必要なのは是だけ 認めて
touch my body, acknowledge that this alone is what I need.

320
00:40:45,482 --> 00:40:57,002
不穏な悲鳴を愛さないで 未来等見ないで 確信出来る 現在だけ重ねてあたしの名前をちゃんと呼んで
Don't love ominous screams, don't look toward a future or anything, I can be certain. Just overlap the present moment, call my name properly,

321
00:40:57,262 --> 00:41:08,942
身体を触って 必要なのは是だけ 認めて
touch my body, acknowledge that this alone is what I need.

322
00:41:21,182 --> 00:41:32,502
頬を刺す朝の山手通り 煙草の空き箱を捨てる
Piercing morning on Yamanote Street, throwing away an empty cigarette pack,

323
00:41:33,542 --> 00:41:43,882
今日もまた足の踏み場は無い 小部屋が孤独を甘やかす
today too, there's no place to step, a small room coddling solitude.

324
00:41:44,342 --> 00:41:53,202
さらさらら
rustling...

325
00:42:19,422 --> 00:42:22,542
ねぇ あんたわかっちゃいない
Hey, you don't get it at all.

326
00:42:40,242 --> 00:42:52,422
誰それがお手元の世界に夢中 化け物の飼い方を学んでる
Everyone is obsessed with the world right at their fingertips, learning how to raise a monster.

327
00:42:52,422 --> 00:43:03,202
選ばれる為なら舌を売る 裏切られた分だけ墓を掘る
Selling out my tongue just to be chosen, digging a grave for every betrayal.

328
00:43:04,202 --> 00:43:19,422
逃げるエスケープ エスケープ エスケープ 仏のまま 飛べるステップ ステップ ステップ 仰せのまま
Running, escape, escape, escape, remaining like Buddha, flying, step, step, step, just as told.

329
00:43:19,422 --> 00:43:29,202
アンダスタン アンダスタン どーどー閻魔様さえ喰らって
Understand, understand, devouring even Lord Enma himself.

330
00:43:46,942 --> 00:43:59,302
日々の滲みを木々に焼べて暖をとり合う
Burning daily bleeds onto the trees to keep warm together,

331
00:43:59,302 --> 00:44:09,202
義理を誣いた彼の四肢は散り散りになる 知りもせずに意味を美意識だと崇める
his limbs, having betrayed duty, scatter apart, blindly worshipping meaning as an aesthetic sense.

332
00:44:09,202 --> 00:44:24,422
擬似餌じみた恣意に御の字だった 愉快な御託のフルコースに
We were fine with such pseudo-bait intentions, amidst a full course of pleasant sophistry.

333
00:44:24,422 --> 00:44:36,202
うわべの面をして可愛がった くだんない僧と踊るくらいなら 悪魔と手繋ぐわ
Playing cute with a superficial face—rather than dancing with some useless monk, I'll join hands with the devil.

334
00:44:37,422 --> 00:44:50,202
逃げるエスケープ エスケープ エスケープ 仏のまま 飛べるステップ ステップ ステップ 仰せのまま
Running, escape, escape, escape, remaining like Buddha, flying, step, step, step, just as told.

335
00:44:50,202 --> 00:45:04,642
アンダスタン アンダスタン どーどー閻魔様さえ喰らって
Understand, understand, devouring even Lord Enma himself.

336
00:45:34,880 --> 00:45:38,580
ありがとうございまーす！みんなありがとー！
Thank you so much! Thank you everyone!

337
00:45:39,080 --> 00:45:46,080
はーい、ちょっと待ってね。お水飲んできてくださいね、すいませんね。
Alright, hold on a second. Go grab some water, sorry about that...

338
00:45:49,280 --> 00:46:00,880
お待たせいたしました！お待たせしちゃいましたね。えっと、先ほどはジャンドゥーと罪と罰と阿修羅ちゃんをお届けしましたー！どうでしたでしょうか？
Thanks for waiting! Sorry to keep you waiting. So, earlier we performed "JANE DOE", "Tsumi to Batsu", and "Asura-chan"! How did you like it?

339
00:46:01,580 --> 00:46:05,580
この後もまだまだライブは続きます！まだ披露していないあんな曲やこんな曲が...
The live continues after this too! There are still songs we haven't shown yet...

340
00:46:06,080 --> 00:46:10,580
あんな曲や！こんな曲や！あるかもねー！
Songs like this! Songs like that! There might be some!

341
00:46:10,580 --> 00:46:17,580
なので、チャンネルはそのままでまだ見ててくれたら嬉しいです！ここでみんなにお知らせをさせてください。こちらです！
So I'd be super happy if you keep watching and leave the channel on! Let me make an announcement to everyone. Here it is!

342
00:46:18,080 --> 00:46:23,580
[Title: 響咲リオナ誕生日記念2026グッズが出ます！やったー！]
[Title: Isaki Riona Birthday Celebration 2026 Goods are out! Yay!]

343
00:46:24,580 --> 00:46:28,580
では詳細を見ていきましょう！まずは、こちらです！
Now let's check the details! First up is this!

344
00:46:29,080 --> 00:46:45,080
[Sign: RIONA ON THE ステージ タペストリー] ライブ中のリオナをテーマに描かれたイラストで、とっても可愛いイラストになってるのでタペストリーでぜひ堪能してください！
[Sign: RIONA ON THE STAGE Tapestry] It's an illustration themed around Riona during the live, super cute, so please enjoy it as a tapestry!

345
00:46:46,580 --> 00:46:59,580
[Sign: リオナとおそろい ネックレス] 真ん中には王冠のデザイン、周りにはいさきりおなのロゴが入っていますので、あのシンプルになっていますのでね、ぜひリオナとおそろいにしてくれたら嬉しいです！
[Sign: Riona & Matching Necklace] It features a crown design in the center with Isaki Riona's logo around it. It has a simple design, so I'd be so happy if you wear it matching with Riona!

346
00:47:01,580 --> 00:47:20,080
[Sign: リオナのぬいを入れるポーチ] リオポサ全開のぬいポーチになってます！ぜひまーりおなをね、まーりおなのぬいを入れてくれたら嬉しいなと思います！ぬい以外に使ってもらうのも大丈夫だよ、ポーチになるよ。そしてそして、最後は…こちら！
[Sign: Pouch for Riona's Plushie] It's a plushie pouch packed with Rioposa! I'd be so happy if you put your Riona plushie in it! It's totally fine to use it for other things too, it works as a pouch. And last but not least... this!

347
00:47:21,080 --> 00:47:42,080
[Sign: くしゃみ連発ぬいキーホルダー] 今回描きおろしイラストの衣装のぬいぐるみキーホルダーになってます！なんとね、この手の部分をねポチッて押すと、「はやくしょーん！」て言うので、ぜひいっぱい押してね、いっぱい浴びてもらえればと思います！そして改めてね、フルセットの方全部見ていきましょう！こちら！
[Sign: Sneezing Consecutive Plushie Keychain] It's a plushie keychain in the outfit from the newly drawn illustration! And you know, if you press this part of the hand, it says "Hurry up and sneeze!", so I hope you press it a lot and soak it all in! And let's take a look at the full set again. Here!

348
00:47:43,080 --> 00:47:48,580
[Sign: 誕生記念フルセット] もちろんフルセット購入特典もあります！こちら！
[Sign: Birthday Commemorative Full Set] Of course, there's also a special bonus for purchasing the full set! Here!

349
00:47:49,080 --> 00:48:10,080
[Sign: フルセット購入特典] フルセット購入特典の1つ目は、直筆サインと直筆メッセージ入りバックステージパス風カードです！こちらも鳴海先生のイラストにすべて私手書きで、1つひとつ「おにゃにゃにゃにゃにゃにゃー」ってサインさせていただきますので、よかったらぜひ買ってみてください！
[Sign: Full Set Purchase Bonus] The first full set purchase bonus is a backstage pass-style card with a handwritten signature and handwritten message! For this one too, I will hand-write everything on Narumi-sensei's illustration, signing each one with "Onyanyanyanyanyaー", so please consider buying it!

350
00:48:11,080 --> 00:48:25,080
[Sign: 特典ボイス「ライブ前に君と。」] ふたつ目は、特典ボイス「ライブ前に君と。」です！ライブ前にね、こう緊張してね「へへへへっ」てなっているリオナを励ますシチュエーションとなっております！ぜひね、ボイスの方も聞いてくれると嬉しいです！
[Sign: Bonus Voice "With You Before the Live"] The second is the bonus voice "With You Before the Live"! It's a situation where Riona is getting all nervous before the live going "hehehehe" and you cheer her up! I'd be so happy if you listen to the voice too.

351
00:48:26,080 --> 00:48:38,080
こちらのグッズは21時9分からカートオープンです！みんなよかったらぜーんぜーんぜーんぜんゲットしてください！そして大事なお知らせがふたつ目あります！聞いてください！
These goods will be available in the cart starting at 21:09! Everyone, please go ahead and get all of them! And there is a second important announcement! Listen up!

352
00:48:39,080 --> 00:48:49,080
どんっ！いさきりおなの初ソロの新曲がでます！やったー！タイトルは「Ring my name」です！
Ta-da! Isaki Riona's first solo new song is coming out! Yay! The title is "Ring my name"!

353
00:48:50,080 --> 00:49:07,080
[Title: Ring my name] こちら私の思い出だったり、これから先どうやってこう進んでいくか、私は進んでいくぞ！というのがおしゃれで妖艶に、エガントに表現された楽曲となっております！こちらセクシーな振り付けもついているのでよかったら服に注目もしてくださると嬉しいです！
[Title: Ring my name] This song stylishly, seductively, and elegantly expresses my memories, how I'm going to move forward from here on, and that I will keep moving forward! It also has sexy choreography, so I'd be happy if you pay attention to the outfit as well!

354
00:49:08,080 --> 00:49:18,080
この後このライブが終わった後すぐにMVも公開されますし、このあと24時からデジタルリリースもあるので、ぜひいっぱい聴いてくれると嬉しいです！
Right after this live ends, the music video will be released, and there's also a digital release starting at 24:00, so I'd be super happy if you listen to it a lot!

355
00:49:19,080 --> 00:49:25,080
やっぱりこのあとは新曲ヤッチャいますよね！というわけでね、まあやっていくんですけど、まあその前のちょっと語らせてくださいよ。
Of course, after this we're doing the new song, right?! So yeah, we're going to do it, but let me talk a bit before that.

356
00:49:26,080 --> 00:49:49,080
まあね、リオナはねまだまだなことがいっぱいで、叶えたい夢もいっぱいあります。なので、まだまだ何も手にしてない私かもしれませんが、一緒に付いてきてくれたあなたと一緒にいろんな夢だったり思い出を作っていきたいです。絶対後悔はさせないので、これからも私についてきてくれると嬉しいです！よろしくお願いします！
You know, Riona still has so many things to achieve and so many dreams she wants to fulfill. So, I might still be someone who hasn't achieved much yet, but I want to create various dreams and memories together with you who have followed along with me. I definitely won't make you regret it, so I'd be happy if you keep following me! Thank you so much!

357
00:49:50,080 --> 00:50:00,116
そしてこのあとは、新曲の披露の前に、ホロライブの先輩方の折り曲を使ったダンスメドレーをお届けします！こちらたくさんのジャンルのダンスを踊る…
And after this, before revealing the new song, we'll deliver a dance medley using choreography from hololive seniors! Here, dancing many genres of dance...

358
00:53:28,216 --> 00:53:31,316
I'm dressed in lace 甘い嘘は act
I'm dressed in lace, sweet lies are an act

359
00:53:31,316 --> 00:53:34,166
囁くの「Want more?」 吐息まで danger
Whispering "Want more?", danger down to my breath

360
00:53:34,166 --> 00:53:36,616
Every step I take 心ごと奪って
Stealing away my very heart with every step I take

361
00:53:36,616 --> 00:53:41,366
Velvet shadows call my name 微熱は隠して
Velvet shadows call my name, hiding the fever

362
00:53:41,366 --> 00:53:45,716
午前零時 今、Veilが解け
At midnight, now the veil unravels

363
00:53:45,716 --> 00:53:49,316
I'm breaking into the night まだ夜は醒めやしない
I'm breaking into the night, the night still hasn't awakened

364
00:53:49,316 --> 00:53:56,116
さあ、誰も彼も焦がれるままで 「私を見て。」
Come on, while everyone yearns and burns, "Look at me."

365
00:53:57,116 --> 00:53:59,916
Ring my name 響かせるわ
Ring my name, let it echo

366
00:53:59,916 --> 00:54:04,316
今から watch me rise Bloom it now 咲き誇れば
From now on, watch me rise, bloom it now, if I bloom proudly

367
00:54:04,316 --> 00:54:08,916
煌めく Reina 指先まで優雅に揺れる
Sparkling Reina, swaying gracefully down to my fingertips

368
00:54:08,916 --> 00:54:13,216
鏡越しの操り人形 壊れそうに微笑んで
A marionette in the mirror, smiling as if she might break

369
00:54:13,616 --> 00:54:16,616
瞳の奥 falling low
Deep in my eyes falling low

370
00:54:16,616 --> 00:54:20,216
唇まで like a ghost I can't stop
Down to my lips like a ghost I can't stop

371
00:54:20,216 --> 00:54:24,916
巡る走馬灯 さあ、魅せましょう 綺麗な嘘で
Revolving memory lane, come on, let's show them with a beautiful lie

372
00:54:24,916 --> 00:54:30,116
着飾らない No Masquerade Go ahead, skip all cheap romance それならばいっそ Shall we dance?
No Masquerade, unadorned with pretty lies. Go ahead, skip all cheap romance. If so, then instead, shall we dance?

373
00:54:30,116 --> 00:54:35,616
Come say Reina! Reina! Reina! It's showtime Flavor, fly, no chaser 今さら Bad マーク 連打 Bot ばっか やってられねーな
Come say Reina! Reina! Reina! It's showtime. Flavor, fly, no chaser. Spamming bad marks now, just bots everywhere, I can't deal with this!

374
00:54:35,616 --> 00:54:43,116
I'm a wonder, can't look away, boy 魅せつけるの 全てを賭けて
I'm a wonder, can't look away, boy. Fascinate them, risking everything.

375
00:54:45,416 --> 00:54:48,916
Click, click, tap, tap, and keep on posing

376
00:54:48,916 --> 00:54:52,316
Flick, flick, snap, snap, and everybody dancing

377
00:54:52,316 --> 00:54:55,616
Click, click, tap, tap, and keep on posing

378
00:54:55,616 --> 00:54:59,916
Flick, flick, snap, snap, and everybody dancing

379
00:56:17,714 --> 00:56:20,864
これからも、私についてきてください！
Please keep following me from now on too!

380
00:56:21,064 --> 00:56:22,914
以上、響咲リオナでした！
That's all from Riona Isaki!

381
00:56:23,164 --> 00:56:24,714
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

382
00:56:30,864 --> 00:57:08,200
[Text: 響咲リオナ生誕祭 2026 お越しいただき、ありがとうございました！！ これからも皆さんとずっと一緒に居たい… 貴方の居場所でありたいです！！ お届けしたパフォーマンスが貴方の心に少しでも何かが残せているといいな 本当に本当にありがとう！！ 響咲リオナ]
[Text: Riona Isaki Birthday Festival 2026 Thank you so much for coming!! I want to stay together with everyone forever... I want to be a place where you belong!! I hope the performance I delivered leaves something in your heart, even just a little Thank you so, so much!! Isaki Riona]

